segments.translation:
예를 들어, 방정식 <me>x\vec{1 2 6} + y \vec{-1 -2 -1} = \vec{8 16 3}</me>는 다음과 같이 간단히 정리됩니다. <me>\vec{ x 2x 6x} + \vec{-y -2y -y} = \vec{8 16 3}
\sptxt{or}
\spalignsysdelims()\syseq{ x - y; 2x - 2y; 6x - y} = \vec{8 16 3}.
    </me>

segments.source:
In order to actually solve the vector equation
    <me>x\textcolor{seq-red}{\vec{1 2 6}}
    + y \textcolor{seq-green}{\vec{-1 -2 -1}}
    = \textcolor{seq-blue}{\vec{8 16 3}},</me>
    one has to solve the system of linear equations
    <me>\spalignsysdelims\{.\syseq{x - y = 8; 2x - 2y = 16; 6x - y = 3\rlap.}</me>
    This means forming the augmented matrix
    <me>\def\r{\color{seq-red}}\def\g{\color{seq-green}}\def\b{\color{seq-blue}}
    \amat{\r1 \g-1 \b8; \r2 \g-2 \b16; \r6 \g-1 \b3}</me>
    and row reducing.

segments.translation:
벡터 방정식 <me>x\textcolor{seq-red}{\vec{1 2 6}}
    + y \textcolor{seq-green}{\vec{-1 -2 -1}}
    = \textcolor{seq-blue}{\vec{8 16 3}},</me>를 실제로 풀려면 연립일차방정식 <me>\spalignsysdelims\{.\syseq{x - y = 8; 2x - 2y = 16; 6x - y = 3\rlap.}</me>를 풀어야 합니다. 이는 첨가행렬 <me>\def\r{\color{seq-red}}\def\g{\color{seq-green}}\def\b{\color{seq-blue}}
    \amat{\r1 \g-1 \b8; \r2 \g-2 \b16; \r6 \g-1 \b3}</me>를 만들고 행 축약을 하는 것을 의미합니다.

